<name>Places near Jerusalem connected with the life of Christ</name>
<open>1</open>
<description><![CDATA[Detailed, citation-rich placemarks for Gospel geography in Jerusalem and the surrounding region. Folders separate strong geographic identifications, plausible locations, later commemorative traditions, and competing Emmaus proposals. A marker can identify the right town or landscape while the exact event-site remains unknown.]]></description>
