<Placemark>
<name>Approximate Palm Sunday landscape route</name>
<styleUrl>#route-approximate-palm-sunday-landscape-route</styleUrl>
<description><![CDATA[<p>A schematic line joining Bethany, traditional Bethphage, the Mount of Olives, Kidron, and the Temple area. It visualizes the named sequence in the Synoptic Gospels; it is not a claim that every segment follows the first-century road.</p><p><b>Caution:</b> Schematic interpretive line, not a GPS reconstruction.</p>]]></description>
<LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><coordinates>35.265200,31.770900,0 35.250840,31.777620,0 35.243890,31.778330,0 35.238400,31.777520,0 35.235830,31.778060,0</coordinates></LineString>
</Placemark>
<Style id="route-traditional-via-dolorosa-framework-antonia-theory"><LineStyle><color>ff0000ff</color><width>4</width></LineStyle></Style>
<Placemark>
<name>Traditional Via Dolorosa framework (Antonia theory)</name>
<styleUrl>#route-traditional-via-dolorosa-framework-antonia-theory</styleUrl>
<description><![CDATA[<p>A schematic version of the eastern devotional route from the Antonia/Ecce Homo area to the Holy Sepulchre. The present stations developed over time, and the route depends on the disputed Antonia-praetorium identification.</p><p><b>Caution:</b> Schematic interpretive line, not a GPS reconstruction.</p>]]></description>
<LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><coordinates>35.233990,31.780560,0 35.232800,31.780100,0 35.231400,31.779100,0 35.229720,31.778330,0</coordinates></LineString>
</Placemark>
<Style id="route-western-palace-passion-route-hypothesis"><LineStyle><color>ffff8800</color><width>4</width></LineStyle></Style>
<Placemark>
<name>Western-palace Passion route hypothesis</name>
<styleUrl>#route-western-palace-passion-route-hypothesis</styleUrl>
<description><![CDATA[<p>A schematic route from Herod&#x27;s western palace, the leading modern praetorium candidate, toward the Holy Sepulchre quarry area. The precise first-century streets and execution procession are unrecoverable.</p><p><b>Caution:</b> Schematic interpretive line, not a GPS reconstruction.</p>]]></description>
<LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><coordinates>35.228200,31.776100,0 35.228800,31.777000,0 35.229720,31.778330,0</coordinates></LineString>
</Placemark>
